Demonstrative_Examples.Demonstrative_Example[0].Body_Text[1].xhtml:ul.xhtml:li[3].xhtml:div: SIGHUP-handler begins to execute, calling syslog().
Demonstrative_Examples.Demonstrative_Example[0].Body_Text[1].xhtml:ul.xhtml:li[4].xhtml:div: syslog() calls malloc(), which is non-reentrant. malloc() begins to modify metadata to manage the heap.
